# Legal & Compliance Audit Command

When the user says **"run legal audit"**, **"run compliance audit"**, **"legal/compliance audit"**, or **"run legal compliance audit"**:

## What to do

1. Launch one subagent (generalPurpose) and instruct it to follow `docs/process/legal-compliance-audit-process.md`.
2. Require output report at `docs/audits/legal-compliance/YYYY-MM-DD-legal-compliance-audit.md`.
3. Audit only. Do not make code changes.
4. After completion, summarize top findings, report location, and repeat that this lane is not a substitute for legal counsel.

## References

- Process: `docs/process/legal-compliance-audit-process.md`
- Reports: `docs/audits/legal-compliance/`
